  "prefLabel": "App 102.02 Apprenticeship agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.02 \"Apprenticeship agreement\" means a written agreement between an apprentice and the sponsor, which contains the terms and conditions of the employment and training of the apprentice.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
